    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 2026-06-09; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Lean; more animated than at intake</td></tr><tr><td>Breast</td><td>Examined with his agreement: glandular tissue about 3 cm behind each nipple, softer and only mildly tender; no discrete mass, skin change, discharge, or nodes</td></tr><tr><td>Mental status</td><td>Alert; mood &quot;better, but grey&quot;; affect mildly constricted and reactive; thought process linear; no suicidal ideation; insight and judgment good</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

